# Mega-TU module manifest for native-compose option (A) — see
# sv0c/doc/native-compose-tradeoffs.md. Paths relative to sv0c/, in pipeline order.
# Assembled by scripts/assemble-sv0-megaTU.py (./scripts/sv0 assemble-megatu).
#
# A1 status: FRONT-END only (lex -> parse -> resolve). These modules concatenate
# without collisions once test mains/tests are stripped. Back-end modules
# (checker, ir, lowering, codegen, bytecode, vm_codegen, link, include_expand)
# redefine core types (Expr/Value/Instr/Ty) DIFFERENTLY, so they need per-module
# type namespacing (RENAME_TYPES in the assembler) before they can be added.

lib/span.sv0
lib/diagnostic.sv0
lib/lexer.sv0
lib/ast.sv0
lib/parser.sv0
